WEBVTT

01:30.350 --> 01:34.890
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.289 --> 01:37.600
[Episode 6]

01:38.000 --> 01:38.680
Mr. Liu,

01:39.640 --> 01:42.070
could you let us
make your two daughters as bait

01:42.070 --> 01:43.039
to lure out the Demon King

01:43.039 --> 01:44.200
and rid the people of this menace?

01:44.200 --> 01:45.220
Absolutely not!

01:45.400 --> 01:45.759
I...

01:45.759 --> 01:46.920
The Feiyu Guard here,

01:46.920 --> 01:48.050
so don't worry, sir.

01:48.070 --> 01:50.150
We will make sure she's completely safe.

01:50.150 --> 01:51.870
This great demon is way too rampant.

01:51.870 --> 01:53.350
If we don't figure out a way to kill it,

01:53.350 --> 01:54.840
-Xiao Yao, let's go.
-more people will die.

01:54.840 --> 01:56.000
There's still no way!

01:56.000 --> 01:57.680
These are my only 2 precious daughters.

01:57.680 --> 01:59.789
I can't just watch them
go to their deaths!

01:59.789 --> 02:02.350
How do you know your family won't be next?

02:02.560 --> 02:04.690
My family will definitely not be next.

02:14.030 --> 02:15.560
Tan'er wants to see you.

02:19.000 --> 02:19.470
Tan'er?

02:20.680 --> 02:22.120
Any updates on the great demon?

02:22.120 --> 02:23.920
Hong Ye wasn't the one behind it.

02:24.960 --> 02:25.890
You heard it all?

02:27.190 --> 02:28.790
How do you know it wasn't him?

02:29.079 --> 02:30.230
I just know.

02:30.400 --> 02:31.400
You saw him today?

02:31.630 --> 02:32.110
Nope.

02:35.360 --> 02:36.400
You did see him.

02:40.030 --> 02:41.890
Tan'er, why didn't you summon me?

02:44.430 --> 02:45.000
Sir,

02:45.430 --> 02:47.710
she's that female swindler from before!

02:47.870 --> 02:50.360
She stepped on and damaged the tiles
of my office in broad daylight.

02:50.360 --> 02:51.680
This is illegal!

02:52.840 --> 02:55.190
I came with good intentions to be bait
in place of your daughters

02:55.190 --> 02:56.720
to lure out the great demon.

02:57.150 --> 02:58.810
Okay, step wherever you like.

04:04.800 --> 04:06.140
Tell our men to fall back a bit.

04:06.140 --> 04:06.470
Yes.

04:18.600 --> 04:19.240
This mist

04:19.870 --> 04:21.329
doesn't seem quite right.

04:36.890 --> 04:37.520
Xiao Yao!

04:52.270 --> 04:52.850
Xiao Yao!

05:10.560 --> 05:11.310
Xiao Yao!

05:11.800 --> 05:12.860
Come back quickly!

05:24.360 --> 05:25.560
You go find boats now to cross

05:25.560 --> 05:26.600
the river and catch up with me.

05:26.600 --> 05:27.260
-Yes.
-Yes.

05:29.240 --> 05:31.070
Guys, take our time to look for boats.

05:31.070 --> 05:31.890
No rush.

06:39.370 --> 06:40.030
Hong Ye?

07:01.550 --> 07:02.190
Xiao Yao?

07:31.430 --> 07:32.000
Tan'er,

07:33.070 --> 07:34.800
which direction is it exactly?

07:40.220 --> 07:41.159
Lord Bingzhu!

07:43.360 --> 07:45.030
Lord Bingzhu, this way!

07:45.159 --> 07:45.750
Xiao Yao?

07:45.750 --> 07:46.270
Come on!

07:53.870 --> 07:54.670
There you are.

07:58.040 --> 08:00.060
I have been waiting for you all this time,

08:00.060 --> 08:01.520
waiting for you to find me.

08:02.830 --> 08:04.830
You've been waiting for me?

08:09.360 --> 08:11.360
Ever since you left Demons' Valley,

08:11.720 --> 08:13.180
I've been waiting for you,

08:14.370 --> 08:15.700
waiting for your return

08:16.630 --> 08:17.650
to my side.

08:20.340 --> 08:22.600
Why are you suddenly telling me all this?

08:29.270 --> 08:30.200
I don't know why,

08:30.850 --> 08:32.030
but seeing you

08:32.870 --> 08:34.530
always makes me feel so happy.

08:35.730 --> 08:36.809
The moment we part,

08:38.320 --> 08:40.179
I just can't wait to see you again.

08:41.270 --> 08:42.130
What about you?

08:42.350 --> 08:43.750
Do you feel the same way?

08:52.330 --> 08:54.010
I don't know why I like you,

08:54.740 --> 08:55.600
but I know

08:57.120 --> 08:58.320
that with you around,

08:59.570 --> 09:01.680
I can't see anyone else.

09:09.750 --> 09:10.390
Xiao Yao,

09:11.800 --> 09:12.940
from now on,

09:13.570 --> 09:14.720
we'll be together.

09:16.230 --> 09:17.490
I'll stay by your side,

09:18.150 --> 09:19.000
cherish you,

09:20.080 --> 09:22.540
watch the sun rise
and set with you every day,

09:23.040 --> 09:25.670
and even reach for the stars
and the moon for you.

09:25.670 --> 09:26.800
Would you like that?

09:28.800 --> 09:30.520
I want to be with you forever.

09:32.320 --> 09:33.150
But,

09:33.900 --> 09:36.020
there's one final condition.

09:37.280 --> 09:38.260
What condition?

09:41.870 --> 09:44.560
You have to become a complete demon,

09:45.080 --> 09:46.510
feed on human blood

09:47.410 --> 09:48.740
to increase your power,

09:50.000 --> 09:52.060
and never return to the mortal world.

10:10.830 --> 10:11.530
Xiao Yao!

10:44.960 --> 10:45.960
Brother!

11:01.780 --> 11:02.780
Brother!

11:04.040 --> 11:05.640
Save me, please!

11:06.030 --> 11:08.500
Brother! It hurts so much!

11:09.000 --> 11:09.720
Tan'er?

11:12.150 --> 11:13.170
Did you really

11:14.110 --> 11:15.600
kill those women?

11:17.840 --> 11:19.830
No, I won't eat humans.

11:20.160 --> 11:21.100
Absolutely not.

11:21.680 --> 11:22.880
If you don't eat them,

11:23.320 --> 11:25.250
you just can't become a pure demon.

11:25.680 --> 11:28.170
You'll also have to die like those women

11:28.790 --> 11:30.190
at the bottom of the lake.

11:30.480 --> 11:30.960
No.

11:33.440 --> 11:34.500
You're not Hong Ye!

11:34.550 --> 11:35.600
You're not Hong Ye!

11:35.600 --> 11:36.320
Who are you?

11:36.360 --> 11:37.240
I am Hong Ye.

11:37.320 --> 11:38.630
-Let go of me!
-Don't you recognize me?

11:38.630 --> 11:40.010
You're not Hong Ye!

11:45.320 --> 11:46.300
Bingzhu!

11:47.120 --> 11:48.000
Help!

11:48.510 --> 11:49.320
Bingzhu.

11:50.080 --> 11:51.360
Hurry!

11:53.150 --> 11:54.140
Save me!

11:54.360 --> 11:56.030
It really hurts so much.

11:56.840 --> 11:57.600
Bingzhu...

11:58.870 --> 12:00.120
Help me.

12:01.720 --> 12:03.200
Bingzhu!

12:05.340 --> 12:06.010
Is that you?

12:06.270 --> 12:06.960
Help me!

12:06.980 --> 12:07.680
Tan'er?

12:12.120 --> 12:12.920
Stop running.

12:14.450 --> 12:17.450
You don't need to exhaust yourself
on the run anymore.

12:17.460 --> 12:19.660
Anyway, you're never needed as a human.

12:19.850 --> 12:21.810
Why not just turn into a demon

12:22.240 --> 12:24.030
and return all your sufferings

12:24.430 --> 12:26.930
to those who bullied you?

12:36.990 --> 12:37.570
Xiao Yao?

12:40.240 --> 12:40.830
Xiao Yao!

12:57.630 --> 12:59.100
You should call me

12:59.440 --> 13:00.600
Ning'an.

13:25.200 --> 13:26.930
Why are you afraid to look at me?

13:40.440 --> 13:41.320
Hong Ye,

13:42.520 --> 13:43.470
you once said

13:44.830 --> 13:45.710
that you would

13:46.830 --> 13:47.990
die for me.

13:49.070 --> 13:50.270
If you love me,

13:51.140 --> 13:52.860
then give me your life.

14:40.150 --> 14:40.700
Xiao Yao!

14:51.560 --> 14:52.030
My Lord!

14:52.030 --> 14:52.490
My Lord!

14:52.720 --> 14:53.480
My Lord!

14:55.000 --> 14:56.320
Are you real or an illusion?

14:56.320 --> 14:57.170
My Lord! My Lord!

14:57.170 --> 14:57.840
It's me,

14:58.710 --> 14:59.430
Ji Yan.

15:01.300 --> 15:02.550
If you're real,

15:03.080 --> 15:04.090
then retreat.

15:04.550 --> 15:05.780
Go back the way you came.

15:05.780 --> 15:06.240
Pardon?

15:07.000 --> 15:07.790
Retreat!

15:09.550 --> 15:09.960
Yes.

15:40.670 --> 15:41.200
Xiao Yao!

15:42.630 --> 15:43.150
It's me.

15:45.510 --> 15:46.230
Don't touch me!

15:46.230 --> 15:47.500
Don't touch me!

15:47.910 --> 15:48.510
Go away!

15:48.510 --> 15:49.640
I'm the real Hong Ye.

15:49.750 --> 15:51.080
-You summoned me with the jade pendant,
-Let go of me!

15:51.080 --> 15:52.210
so I came to find you.

15:54.310 --> 15:55.190
It's really me.

15:56.320 --> 15:58.520
No matter what happened to you just now,

15:58.590 --> 16:00.060
it was just a dream.

16:00.870 --> 16:01.890
It's over now.

16:09.750 --> 16:11.840
You're Hong Ye for real?

16:12.790 --> 16:13.390
You are

16:13.960 --> 16:15.200
the real Hong Ye?

16:15.840 --> 16:16.390
No.

16:18.330 --> 16:19.360
I'm the old demon.

16:28.560 --> 16:29.360
There, there.

16:35.440 --> 16:36.030
Don't be afraid.

16:36.030 --> 16:37.640
I thought I was going to...

16:39.360 --> 16:39.980
It's okay.

16:40.600 --> 16:41.600
It's all over now.

16:52.700 --> 16:54.430
This outfit was a gift from you.

16:56.510 --> 16:58.260
I can give you another one.

16:58.870 --> 17:00.910
I have plenty of money anyway.

17:00.930 --> 17:02.530
Money, money, money.

17:02.560 --> 17:04.160
All you think about is money.

17:04.490 --> 17:06.440
Money can't get you everything.

17:08.550 --> 17:10.210
At least it can get me clothes.

17:11.829 --> 17:12.720
Fine.

17:13.400 --> 17:15.210
Buy whatever you want since you're rich.

17:15.210 --> 17:17.109
You might as well
buy me several more outfits

17:17.109 --> 17:19.109
for you mess up with your tears, huh?

17:28.310 --> 17:30.400
This time, I really needed help
to save my life.

17:30.400 --> 17:33.220
I didn't summon you for no reason.

17:33.920 --> 17:35.520
I wasn't blaming you before.

17:37.110 --> 17:38.580
Where are we?

17:38.640 --> 17:40.400
It looks like an ordinary forest,

17:40.400 --> 17:43.110
but somehow everything feels so weird.

17:44.340 --> 17:45.740
This is the Misty Forest.

17:46.200 --> 17:47.400
What you saw earlier were

17:47.400 --> 17:49.330
all illusions created by the mist.

17:49.550 --> 17:51.070
It can reflect the deepest desires

17:51.070 --> 17:52.070
buried inside you

17:52.610 --> 17:54.540
and manipulate your body and mind.

17:55.600 --> 17:56.260
Xiao Yao,

17:56.770 --> 17:57.930
from now on,

17:58.710 --> 18:00.170
we'll be together.

18:00.380 --> 18:01.640
I'll stay by your side,

18:01.860 --> 18:02.760
cherish you,

18:03.200 --> 18:05.200
watch the sun rise
and set with you every day,

18:05.200 --> 18:07.700
and even reach for the stars
and the moon for you.

18:07.700 --> 18:08.830
Would you like that?

18:11.880 --> 18:12.940
What did you

18:14.250 --> 18:15.160
see just now?

18:16.350 --> 18:17.110
Nothing.

18:17.110 --> 18:18.240
I saw nothing.

18:20.110 --> 18:22.170
What about you? Did you see anything?

18:24.750 --> 18:25.350
I...

18:27.310 --> 18:29.840
I saw nothing but you
as soon as I entered here.

18:38.190 --> 18:38.900
Well, then,

18:39.070 --> 18:40.270
perhaps we should...

18:40.270 --> 18:42.000
We should get out of here first.

18:43.400 --> 18:43.830
Mm.

18:49.110 --> 18:50.050
Stay behind me.

19:12.000 --> 19:13.440
Did you see anyone else

19:13.830 --> 19:15.790
besides me in this forest just now?

19:16.160 --> 19:16.960
-No.
-Nope.

19:19.400 --> 19:19.920
My Lord,

19:20.790 --> 19:21.590
did we lose

19:21.920 --> 19:22.920
that girl?

19:24.900 --> 19:26.700
She must still be in this forest.

19:28.240 --> 19:30.150
But this mist is so spooky

19:30.320 --> 19:32.250
that it can manipulate one's mind.

19:33.550 --> 19:35.810
We can't let our men take this risk again.

19:36.490 --> 19:36.920
Yes.

19:47.070 --> 19:49.370
Little kitty, why are you here alone?

19:51.020 --> 19:52.100
Are you lost?

20:20.960 --> 20:21.720
Flower Lady!

20:25.440 --> 20:26.300
Flower Lady,

20:26.680 --> 20:27.940
where did you go again?

20:30.510 --> 20:31.440
I hear you.

20:31.880 --> 20:32.610
Come on over.

20:35.160 --> 20:35.890
Flower Lady!

20:36.670 --> 20:37.400
Flower Lady.

20:38.750 --> 20:41.350
You naughty thing,
I told you not to run around.

20:42.400 --> 20:43.200
Stop meowing.

20:48.150 --> 20:48.800
Li?

20:49.310 --> 20:50.240
Why are you here?

20:51.220 --> 20:52.260
I've found Flower Lady.

20:51.990 --> 20:53.770
[Li]

20:52.360 --> 20:53.260
Let's go back.

21:09.040 --> 21:09.590
Let's go.

21:19.850 --> 21:21.080
We made it out.

21:22.460 --> 21:23.460
Let me take a rest.

21:24.070 --> 21:25.750
We're finally out of there.

21:26.440 --> 21:27.750
What a creepy place.

21:28.640 --> 21:29.770
That girl just now

21:30.270 --> 21:32.530
seems to be the Qionghua Sect's heiress.

21:32.660 --> 21:34.270
It's all your fault.
I didn't even get to ask her properly

21:34.270 --> 21:35.800
before you dragged me away.

21:36.270 --> 21:37.920
This forest is so eerie that you are

21:37.920 --> 21:39.350
lucky enough to have made it out.

21:39.350 --> 21:40.310
Yet you're blaming me?

21:40.310 --> 21:41.450
You're a man.

21:41.750 --> 21:44.030
In the human world,
even if women speak recklessly,

21:44.030 --> 21:45.430
men shouldn't talk back.

21:45.480 --> 21:47.200
Fine. I won't argue with you.

21:49.510 --> 21:50.580
That masked one,

21:50.960 --> 21:52.180
is he a human or a demon?

21:52.180 --> 21:53.180
Why did you look

21:53.200 --> 21:54.180
so alarmed?

21:54.270 --> 21:55.730
I'm not quite sure either.

21:56.480 --> 21:57.750
I could only sense

21:57.960 --> 21:59.820
a very different aura around him.

22:00.240 --> 22:01.440
He's not like a demon,

22:02.030 --> 22:03.490
and even less like a human.

22:04.240 --> 22:05.640
Neither human nor demon?

22:05.720 --> 22:07.580
Isn't he basically the same as me?

22:10.640 --> 22:11.240
By the way,

22:11.840 --> 22:13.300
where are Luoluo and Dali?

22:15.240 --> 22:16.230
In Pingjiang,

22:17.030 --> 22:17.720
at the magistrate's office.

22:17.720 --> 22:18.920
They've been caught?

22:21.260 --> 22:22.320
Did you come here

22:22.790 --> 22:23.720
because of them?

22:26.440 --> 22:27.030
No.

22:34.800 --> 22:35.530
Actually...

22:38.680 --> 22:39.810
My feet fell asleep.

22:44.450 --> 22:46.500
Six girls died in Pingjiang.

22:48.290 --> 22:50.440
And the Qionghua Sect's heiress
has gone missing.

22:50.440 --> 22:52.240
They all say you're the culprit.

22:52.240 --> 22:53.550
I just want to prove to them

22:53.550 --> 22:54.530
that you're not.

23:04.070 --> 23:04.530
Come on,

23:05.070 --> 23:07.330
go back to Demons' Valley with me for now.

23:08.510 --> 23:09.370
Hold on.

23:09.400 --> 23:11.010
What about the blade?
We haven't got it yet.

23:11.010 --> 23:12.680
I had Xiao Mu mention stealing the blade

23:12.680 --> 23:14.400
just in order to give you
a chance to leave.

23:14.400 --> 23:15.930
Demons' Valley is safe now.

23:15.950 --> 23:17.740
You can do anything as you wish.

23:18.560 --> 23:20.090
What about Luoluo and Dali?

23:20.400 --> 23:21.130
Don't worry.

23:21.160 --> 23:22.260
After ensuring your safety,

23:22.260 --> 23:23.390
I'll go pick them up.

23:24.590 --> 23:25.390
Also...

23:25.480 --> 23:26.830
What about the charges I brought upon you?

23:26.830 --> 23:28.490
Demons' Valley has its rules.

23:28.570 --> 23:30.370
We can't risk our people's lives

23:30.440 --> 23:32.400
just because of Hei Wu's assertion.

23:32.400 --> 23:34.000
My body has fully recovered,

23:34.030 --> 23:35.410
with my power greatly boosted.

23:35.410 --> 23:37.440
If they dare disturb the order again,

23:37.440 --> 23:39.520
I will definitely banish them
from Demons' Valley.

23:39.520 --> 23:40.120
By the way,

23:40.740 --> 23:41.960
Bamboo is still young.

23:41.960 --> 23:43.640
Don't take his behaviors personally.

23:43.640 --> 23:44.500
When I return,

23:44.670 --> 23:46.530
I'll make sure he treats you well.

23:54.360 --> 23:55.410
Does this jade pendant

23:55.410 --> 23:57.140
stop working in water?

23:58.690 --> 23:59.320
No.

24:01.590 --> 24:03.960
Then why didn't you come
when I almost drowned

24:03.960 --> 24:04.890
last time?

24:08.650 --> 24:09.500
You came?

24:11.440 --> 24:12.270
You did come!

24:12.440 --> 24:15.100
So you were the one who saved me
last time, right?

24:15.920 --> 24:16.400
Mm.

24:17.500 --> 24:19.770
That blade also attracted
the Feiyu Guards.

24:19.770 --> 24:21.660
I didn't want to fight them
in the human realm.

24:21.660 --> 24:22.590
Seeing you safe,

24:22.680 --> 24:23.680
I just left first.

24:27.160 --> 24:28.510
What about that time at the inn?

24:28.510 --> 24:30.830
I summoned you in water at the inn, too.

24:34.210 --> 24:34.720
Mm.

24:36.050 --> 24:37.070
So that means you...

24:37.070 --> 24:37.750
I didn't.

24:37.750 --> 24:38.680
I saw nothing.

24:38.800 --> 24:40.400
I just hid behind the screen.

24:40.640 --> 24:41.880
I haven't even said what it was,

24:41.880 --> 24:43.550
but you already know
what I'm talking about.

24:43.550 --> 24:45.380
That means you did see me!

24:45.480 --> 24:47.240
-I...
-You saw me!

24:47.720 --> 24:48.550
Xiao Yao,

24:48.550 --> 24:50.740
i-it was you who summoned me.

24:51.110 --> 24:51.510
But...

24:52.110 --> 24:54.280
But you did see me, didn't you?

24:58.070 --> 25:00.160
Xiao Yao, I really didn't see anything.

25:00.160 --> 25:01.890
I only saw you in the wooden tub.

25:02.500 --> 25:03.370
No, I mean...

25:03.830 --> 25:05.160
I-I didn't see the wooden tub.

25:05.160 --> 25:06.480
I did see the wooden tub.

25:06.480 --> 25:08.400
I just... I just didn't see you.

25:08.400 --> 25:09.310
Then I totally freaked out

25:09.310 --> 25:10.870
and hid inside the wooden tub...

25:10.870 --> 25:12.470
I just hid behind the screen.

25:12.640 --> 25:13.680
I really didn't see you.

25:13.680 --> 25:14.540
I could only...

25:19.270 --> 25:20.200
Not mad anymore?

25:20.500 --> 25:21.630
Mm, not mad anymore.

25:22.350 --> 25:23.080
Not anymore.

25:50.550 --> 25:51.270
Stop!

25:52.030 --> 25:53.200
Who allowed you to shoot?

25:53.200 --> 25:55.060
There's still a human on the boat!

25:57.510 --> 25:58.130
Xiao Yao!

25:58.910 --> 26:00.660
You've already lured out Hong Ye,

26:00.660 --> 26:02.480
proving that you're a human, not a demon.

26:02.480 --> 26:03.680
Jump off the boat now!

26:05.310 --> 26:05.960
My Lord,

26:06.200 --> 26:07.030
give the order to shoot.

26:07.030 --> 26:08.200
Forget about Xiao Yao now.

26:08.200 --> 26:09.000
Lord Bingzhu,

26:09.000 --> 26:09.920
Hong Ye is not the culprit.

26:09.920 --> 26:10.960
It's someone else!

26:10.960 --> 26:12.590
The Qionghua Sect Leader's daughter is
still alive.

26:12.590 --> 26:13.750
I saw it with my own eyes.

26:13.750 --> 26:15.960
Who else could pull that off
other than him?

26:15.960 --> 26:17.480
Demons are always despicable.

26:17.480 --> 26:18.920
Don't be threatened or bewitched by him!

26:18.920 --> 26:19.680
Bewitched?

26:20.440 --> 26:22.020
You say I'm the culprit.
Where's your evidence?

26:22.020 --> 26:22.840
Shoot!

26:27.830 --> 26:28.690
Another round!

26:41.480 --> 26:43.380
Lord Bingzhu, you can't kill the innocent.

26:43.380 --> 26:44.440
Hong Ye, tell him

26:44.440 --> 26:45.750
that you didn't harm those girls.

26:45.750 --> 26:46.590
Say it now!

26:47.110 --> 26:48.840
I don't need to explain myself
to the Feiyu Guard.

26:48.840 --> 26:50.650
I'll take that as a confession.

26:51.600 --> 26:52.790
Let go of Xiao Yao

26:53.030 --> 26:54.350
and fight me.

26:54.550 --> 26:55.070
Okay.

27:00.410 --> 27:01.210
Lord Bingzhu,

27:01.240 --> 27:02.350
you keep saying he's the culprit.

27:02.350 --> 27:03.750
Do you have any evidence?

27:03.750 --> 27:05.410
What more evidence do we need?

27:06.300 --> 27:08.880
The massacre in the imperial palace
a century ago

27:08.880 --> 27:10.540
and Princess Ning'an's death

27:10.980 --> 27:12.440
both involved him!

27:15.640 --> 27:17.120
My past is

27:17.590 --> 27:19.410
none of your business.

27:19.820 --> 27:21.910
If you dare say one more word,

27:22.750 --> 27:25.350
I'll make sure
you die the most terrible death!

27:25.440 --> 27:26.440
Die!

27:30.590 --> 27:31.110
Tan'er.

27:31.690 --> 27:32.320
Tan'er!

27:39.980 --> 27:40.850
Lord Bingzhu,

27:41.360 --> 27:43.910
no matter how deep the enmity
between humans and demons runs,

27:43.910 --> 27:45.360
if Hong Ye is not the culprit,

27:45.360 --> 27:47.170
he should not bear this unjust blame.

27:47.170 --> 27:48.720
I hope you can judge fairly

27:48.750 --> 27:50.690
and hurry to find the real culprit.

27:51.550 --> 27:53.130
The real culprit?

27:56.350 --> 27:57.000
Very well.

27:57.920 --> 27:59.790
When I get to the bottom of it,

28:00.840 --> 28:03.100
I'll make sure you die fair and square.

28:08.240 --> 28:10.000
My Lord, you used retreat to advance.

28:10.000 --> 28:11.210
What a wise move.

28:15.550 --> 28:16.080
Retreat.

28:27.830 --> 28:28.760
Are you alright?

28:29.560 --> 28:30.130
My Lord.

28:32.810 --> 28:35.210
See if you want the memorial
to go like this.

28:36.070 --> 28:37.400
"The Feiyu Guards surrounded

28:37.400 --> 28:38.680
the great demon, Hong Ye, at the lake

28:38.680 --> 28:40.140
and fought him for 4 hours.

28:40.440 --> 28:42.100
Hong Ye was severely wounded.

28:42.190 --> 28:43.640
Though he made a narrow escape,

28:43.640 --> 28:44.510
he was already at death's door,

28:44.510 --> 28:46.040
unable to harm anyone else.

28:46.440 --> 28:47.370
The Feiyu Guards

28:47.440 --> 28:49.440
have mobilized Zhou City's officials
to pursue with full force

28:49.440 --> 28:51.450
and will eliminate the demon soon."

28:53.260 --> 28:55.520
Do you want to bring
even more shame on us?

29:00.680 --> 29:01.480
Commander Ji,

29:02.830 --> 29:04.310
please tell our men to keep

29:05.480 --> 29:07.210
what happened at the lake today

29:08.480 --> 29:09.550
a secret.

29:10.330 --> 29:11.060
Understood.

29:14.680 --> 29:16.340
Give His Lordship some space.

29:18.110 --> 29:19.240
Take a break, guys.

29:20.760 --> 29:21.330
Tan'er,

29:23.070 --> 29:24.880
what's wrong with you today?

29:28.130 --> 29:29.470
Do you also believe

29:30.640 --> 29:32.770
that Hong Ye is not truly an evil demon?

29:38.140 --> 29:40.240
Princess Ning'an died because of you.

29:40.240 --> 29:41.710
Is that true?

29:43.130 --> 29:43.810
Xiao Yao,

29:45.810 --> 29:46.600
don't ask.

29:52.550 --> 29:55.070
I must look like her so much

29:56.400 --> 29:58.460
so that you mistook me for her when you

29:59.320 --> 30:00.810
saw me for the first time.

30:10.590 --> 30:12.440
If I looked nothing like her,

30:13.650 --> 30:15.710
would you still protect me like this?

30:22.710 --> 30:24.310
You're not saying anything.

30:35.050 --> 30:37.180
At first, I did mistake you for her,

30:38.250 --> 30:40.530
but later I realized
you're not the same person.

30:40.530 --> 30:41.140
Now,

30:42.240 --> 30:43.440
no matter who you are,

30:43.470 --> 30:44.080
I will...

30:44.110 --> 30:46.910
There's no "before"
or "after" about my identity.

30:47.410 --> 30:48.570
My name is Xiao Yao.

30:49.460 --> 30:51.200
I've been called Xiao Yao my entire life,

30:51.200 --> 30:52.350
not some "Ning'an."

31:23.440 --> 31:25.550
I know you're only nice to me

31:25.570 --> 31:27.700
because I look like Princess Ning'an.

31:28.900 --> 31:30.690
I've accepted it to stay alive.

31:31.350 --> 31:32.130
That's it.

31:33.900 --> 31:34.880
I'm just curious

31:34.880 --> 31:37.240
about what exactly happened
between you two.

31:37.240 --> 31:38.150
Just asking.

31:41.110 --> 31:42.130
Looks like

31:42.480 --> 31:44.940
this is really not something
I can ask about.

31:46.640 --> 31:47.970
Forget I said anything.

31:53.250 --> 31:54.780
Just some bygones. There's

31:57.840 --> 31:59.500
no need to bring them up again.

32:14.030 --> 32:15.960
I suppose this jade pendant wasn't

32:16.670 --> 32:18.510
meant to protect me, either.

32:20.590 --> 32:22.160
In all my travels,

32:22.160 --> 32:24.020
I never did anything I regretted.

32:26.440 --> 32:28.100
But now, my greatest regret is

32:31.200 --> 32:33.760
that I accidentally woke you up.

32:41.830 --> 32:44.960
♪ Fear that the red thread that bound us,
the vows we engraved ♪

32:45.350 --> 32:46.030
Fine.

32:46.060 --> 32:49.240
♪ The "forever" we swore are
meant to miss their mark ♪

32:49.200 --> 32:50.460
Since you regret it...

32:55.760 --> 32:59.030
♪ Afraid of the exchanged life and death,
the arrows blocking the way ♪

33:00.040 --> 33:04.230
♪ The chains that are hard to break,
hard to distinguish ♪

33:07.650 --> 33:09.970
♪ Perhaps it's all for nothing ♪

33:11.010 --> 33:13.600
♪ Love and hate are nothing more ♪

33:14.380 --> 33:18.720
♪ Than a scene we rush through ♪

33:21.990 --> 33:24.190
♪ Afraid of giving my true heart ♪

33:25.260 --> 33:27.620
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

33:30.100 --> 33:32.020
♪ Boiling hot ♪

33:37.270 --> 33:39.160
Bad demon, shady demon.

33:39.880 --> 33:40.590
Selfish!

33:41.310 --> 33:42.770
Left without hesitation.

33:44.750 --> 33:46.240
These are chaotic times indeed.

33:46.240 --> 33:47.770
Demons have even infiltrated
the magistrate's office.

33:47.770 --> 33:48.500
Exactly.

33:48.830 --> 33:49.880
No wonder they've failed to catch any!

33:49.880 --> 33:50.310
Yeah.

33:50.310 --> 33:51.680
Aren't they deceiving and betraying us?

33:51.680 --> 33:52.590
Let's go to the magistrate's office.

33:52.590 --> 33:52.920
Let's go!

33:52.920 --> 33:54.380
-Go take a look.
-Let's go.

33:58.510 --> 33:59.780
Dali, Luoluo...

33:59.980 --> 34:02.510
We've searched the entire city
with talismans only to find nothing.

34:02.510 --> 34:03.510
So the demons were

34:03.680 --> 34:05.480
hiding in the magistrate's office!

34:05.480 --> 34:06.710
Can't believe

34:06.830 --> 34:08.880
the dignified government office
harbored demons!

34:08.880 --> 34:10.800
Were it not
for the Qionghua Sect's intelligence,

34:10.800 --> 34:12.320
how long would you plan
to keep them hidden?

34:12.320 --> 34:14.239
The Feiyu Guards ordered us to hide them.

34:14.239 --> 34:15.670
It has nothing to do with our office!

34:15.670 --> 34:17.320
Are you saying

34:18.150 --> 34:19.409
that the Feiyu Guards,

34:19.630 --> 34:21.230
whose job is to catch demons,

34:21.800 --> 34:22.920
actually

34:23.840 --> 34:25.770
keep minor demons?

34:28.630 --> 34:29.920
I didn't say anything just now.

34:29.920 --> 34:31.280
Kill him!

34:31.920 --> 34:32.510
Kill him!

34:32.510 --> 34:33.190
Slay the demons!

34:33.190 --> 34:33.840
Kill him!

34:40.270 --> 34:41.710
The Feiyu Guards have kept
these 2 minor demons

34:41.710 --> 34:43.370
to help investigate the case.

34:43.860 --> 34:46.300
Master Jin, why make such a fuss?

34:48.670 --> 34:50.320
Are there any discoveries?

34:50.920 --> 34:51.980
Another day has passed,

34:51.980 --> 34:53.710
and I still don't know
whether my daughter is alive or not.

34:53.710 --> 34:56.030
Since you, Feiyu Guards, are
so out of your mind,

34:56.030 --> 34:58.160
our Qionghua Sect will uphold justice

34:58.250 --> 34:59.180
and execute them

34:59.800 --> 35:00.860
right here and now!

35:04.180 --> 35:05.520
Luoluo! Luoluo!

35:06.190 --> 35:06.800
Luoluo.

35:06.960 --> 35:07.710
Stop it!

35:12.110 --> 35:13.420
I've found your daughter.

35:13.420 --> 35:14.480
She's still alive.

35:16.680 --> 35:18.060
Where is Yunyi?

35:18.510 --> 35:19.440
Release my 2 friends,

35:19.440 --> 35:21.040
and I'll take you to find her.

35:24.430 --> 35:25.820
Your friends?

35:27.080 --> 35:28.280
Though they are demons,

35:28.280 --> 35:29.740
they have never done any evil things.

35:29.740 --> 35:30.960
The one who took your daughter isn't

35:30.960 --> 35:32.150
Demon King Hong Ye.

35:32.150 --> 35:33.160
I saw it myself.

35:33.670 --> 35:36.470
-My daughter... Where on earth is she?
-Nonsense!

35:37.070 --> 35:40.190
This woman clearly has a demonic aura,

35:40.190 --> 35:42.120
and she's even protecting demons.

35:50.390 --> 35:51.990
Master Jin, please calm down

35:52.070 --> 35:53.670
and don't hurt the innocent.

35:55.630 --> 35:56.840
Qionghua disciples!

35:56.920 --> 35:57.890
-Yes!
-Yes!

35:58.760 --> 36:00.190
Does your daughter have a cat

36:00.190 --> 36:01.250
named Flower Lady?

36:03.170 --> 36:04.230
Only I know

36:04.230 --> 36:05.360
where your daughter is.

36:05.360 --> 36:06.480
If you kill us,

36:06.480 --> 36:08.010
you'll never see her again.

36:12.810 --> 36:13.530
Honey.

36:14.280 --> 36:15.630
You've already exhausted yourself

36:15.630 --> 36:16.590
worrying about our daughter.

36:16.590 --> 36:19.920
Don't force your core energy,
or it'll hurt your meridians.

36:25.030 --> 36:26.590
She's my only daughter.

36:27.870 --> 36:29.860
If anything happens to her,

36:31.070 --> 36:33.190
there would be no point in me living.

36:34.510 --> 36:35.710
Put away your swords!

36:37.310 --> 36:39.590
As long as Yunyi can return
safe and sound,

36:39.590 --> 36:41.120
I'll release your friends.

36:41.960 --> 36:43.240
Good. It's a deal.

36:43.260 --> 36:45.460
I'll give you 3 days. Three days at most.

36:54.240 --> 36:55.700
Deliver meals twice a day.

36:56.320 --> 36:58.030
Don't let any unauthorized persons

36:58.030 --> 36:58.890
approach here.

36:59.070 --> 36:59.420
Yes.

36:59.450 --> 37:00.550
Luoluo has a big appetite.

37:00.550 --> 37:01.360
Dali needs plenty of water

37:01.360 --> 37:02.170
and sunlight.

37:03.380 --> 37:04.710
Change the meals to 3 deliveries a day.

37:04.710 --> 37:06.030
Prepare a large water tank in the room

37:06.030 --> 37:07.510
and allow them out for half an hour daily.

37:07.510 --> 37:07.960
Yes.

37:08.550 --> 37:09.190
Follow me.

37:12.070 --> 37:12.820
Move aside!

37:21.410 --> 37:21.960
Xiao Yao,

37:22.630 --> 37:23.670
be honest with me.

37:24.030 --> 37:24.710
Do you really have

37:24.710 --> 37:27.040
the confidence to bring her back
in 3 days?

37:28.400 --> 37:29.400
I think I can do it.

37:30.670 --> 37:33.590
Do you know that your escape
from that forest today was

37:33.590 --> 37:34.650
pure luck?

37:39.360 --> 37:42.260
[Pingjiang Prefecture] [Misty Forest]

37:40.400 --> 37:40.800
Here is

37:41.550 --> 37:42.590
the Misty Forest.

37:42.850 --> 37:44.880
It's not large, only about 666 hectares.

37:44.880 --> 37:46.840
But it's shrouded in mist all year round

37:46.840 --> 37:47.840
with no sunlight.

37:48.280 --> 37:50.210
Locals don't dare to enter it

37:50.350 --> 37:51.630
because once they go in,

37:51.630 --> 37:53.160
almost none can make it out.

37:53.540 --> 37:55.110
Occasionally, some do escape,

37:55.110 --> 37:57.710
but they never remember
what happened inside.

38:00.000 --> 38:01.940
It's not as terrifying as you say.

38:02.000 --> 38:02.840
If I could escape once,

38:02.840 --> 38:04.070
I can make it again.

38:07.280 --> 38:07.880
By the way,

38:08.360 --> 38:09.160
today you said

38:09.840 --> 38:11.600
you saw the person who kidnapped the girl?

38:11.600 --> 38:12.070
Yes.

38:12.400 --> 38:13.660
What does he look like?

38:14.710 --> 38:16.310
He has an iron hand

38:16.450 --> 38:17.910
and also a mask on his face.

38:18.150 --> 38:19.450
But strangely enough,

38:19.470 --> 38:21.730
he seemed to mean no harm to the girl.

38:21.750 --> 38:23.810
Instead, they appeared quite close.

38:30.650 --> 38:32.910
Has this forest always been so peculiar?

38:34.530 --> 38:35.660
Not really.

38:35.820 --> 38:36.820
Twenty years ago,

38:37.140 --> 38:39.800
a tribe called Hefeng
from the Northern Prairie

38:39.960 --> 38:41.560
grew increasingly powerful

38:41.940 --> 38:44.510
and had frequent conflicts
along our Tiancheng Kingdom's borders.

38:44.510 --> 38:46.620
So they sent an assassination team

38:46.800 --> 38:48.030
into our territory,

38:48.630 --> 38:50.440
intending to assassinate His Majesty.

38:50.440 --> 38:51.710
They were discovered by us

38:51.710 --> 38:53.240
and pursued relentlessly.

38:54.280 --> 38:56.080
Ultimately, they ended up being

38:56.110 --> 38:57.520
eliminated in this forest,

38:57.520 --> 38:59.030
with their bodies cremated.

38:59.030 --> 39:01.010
Perhaps those assassins' resentment was
so strong

39:01.010 --> 39:03.440
that it gathered
to form this mysterious mist

39:03.440 --> 39:04.770
that never dissipates.

39:06.070 --> 39:08.200
So this place became a forbidden area.

39:12.310 --> 39:14.630
Is what you're saying recorded in books

39:14.630 --> 39:15.230
or...

39:15.230 --> 39:18.110
It's recorded in the confidential scrolls
of the Feiyu Guards.

39:18.110 --> 39:20.310
Fine, fine. The Feiyu Guards' records.

39:22.840 --> 39:24.900
But when I entered this forest today,

39:25.250 --> 39:26.110
it felt

39:27.040 --> 39:28.900
like someone had set up a barrier.

39:29.700 --> 39:31.360
This barrier is similar to...

39:33.990 --> 39:35.990
It's like the one in Demons' Valley.

39:36.130 --> 39:38.670
Where there's a barrier,
there must be a passage.

39:38.670 --> 39:40.130
That makes things easier.

39:41.030 --> 39:43.910
[The news of the demon devouring humans
has spread throughout Pingjiang.]

39:43.910 --> 39:44.760
[Suddenly,]

39:44.760 --> 39:47.000
[all the girls started
fleeing from the city.]

39:47.000 --> 39:48.600
[The families
who didn't have time to escape]

39:48.600 --> 39:50.030
[just had their daughters either hidden]

39:50.030 --> 39:51.650
[or disguised as boys]

39:51.920 --> 39:53.770
[to avoid being found by the demon.]

39:53.770 --> 39:54.440
Dad!

39:55.190 --> 39:55.650
Mom!

39:55.710 --> 39:56.230
My dear.

39:56.230 --> 39:57.460
I don't care!

39:57.590 --> 39:58.990
Just listen to my advice.

40:00.110 --> 40:02.360
Staying home every day is
driving me crazy!

40:02.360 --> 40:03.480
-Yeah! I want to hang out!
-So boring!

40:03.480 --> 40:05.080
It's still better to be bored

40:05.590 --> 40:07.640
than get eaten by a demon.

40:08.710 --> 40:09.510
You know what?

40:10.030 --> 40:10.760
That demon

40:11.110 --> 40:14.200
only goes after
beautiful young ladies like you.

40:14.280 --> 40:15.220
If you die,

40:15.510 --> 40:17.410
handsome Lord Bingzhu

40:17.710 --> 40:19.340
will belong to someone else.

40:21.150 --> 40:21.920
Anyway,

40:22.550 --> 40:24.550
crying and making a fuss won't help.

40:24.710 --> 40:25.510
Honey,

40:26.670 --> 40:28.000
nail these doors

40:28.000 --> 40:29.490
shut completely.

40:29.840 --> 40:31.110
From today on,

40:31.360 --> 40:33.020
before the culprit is caught,

40:33.550 --> 40:36.320
no one is allowed
to step outside this room.

40:43.270 --> 40:46.010
My Lord, you seem a bit out of sorts.

40:46.440 --> 40:47.360
Did you

40:47.360 --> 40:49.160
have a fight with Xiao Yao again?

40:50.360 --> 40:50.890
"Again"?

40:51.510 --> 40:52.940
I mean,

40:52.970 --> 40:55.320
having a fight isn't a big deal.

40:56.030 --> 40:58.290
The main issue now is
that Luoluo and Dali

40:58.400 --> 41:00.000
have ended up in human hands.

41:01.030 --> 41:02.030
What should we do?

41:02.930 --> 41:04.990
Their lives are not in danger for now.

41:05.630 --> 41:06.510
And Xiao Yao

41:10.100 --> 41:11.560
will work it out on her own.

41:11.920 --> 41:13.920
With her half-baked demonic power,

41:14.280 --> 41:16.610
she'll probably just get herself killed.

41:18.710 --> 41:20.550
Miss, do you want to buy hemp ropes?

41:20.550 --> 41:22.550
Are these all the hemp ropes you have?
Do you have any more?

41:22.550 --> 41:24.230
Yes, we have more! How many do you need?

41:24.230 --> 41:25.620
I'll take all you have.

41:25.870 --> 41:27.030
Please follow me to the back warehouse.

41:27.030 --> 41:27.890
We have plenty.

41:29.320 --> 41:29.710
Wait.

41:30.230 --> 41:32.090
What do you need so many ropes for?

41:32.510 --> 41:34.840
There's only one way
to enter the Misty Forest.

41:34.840 --> 41:35.770
Wait for me here.

41:41.150 --> 41:41.590
No,

41:42.070 --> 41:44.100
I must go to Pingjiang City myself.

41:44.630 --> 41:45.430
No, you can't.

41:46.440 --> 41:48.240
My Lord, you can go if you want to.

41:48.320 --> 41:49.780
I'll wait for your return.

41:50.150 --> 41:50.510
No...

41:50.840 --> 41:52.440
See? I was right on the money.

41:54.280 --> 41:54.960
I'll take them all.

41:54.960 --> 41:56.710
Please deliver them
to the magistrate's office.

41:56.710 --> 41:57.440
No problem.

42:01.070 --> 42:02.070
Who are you?
